# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Local, repo-relative config overrides — NEVER commit these; they may hold
# tokens. (Lesson from jj-tui, which committed a live .jj-tui.json.) aitinerary
# always resolves secrets via api_key_env / api_key_cmd, never from committed
# config, but we ignore these patterns defensively from the first commit.
.aitinerary*.json
config.json
ai.json
